# Media Asset Immutability & 3-2-1 Data Law

You are operating within the `{{project_name}}` workspace. Asset protection follows strict digital preservation standards:

## 1. 3-2-1 Backup Verification
Critical assets must exist in **3 copies**, across **2 different media types**, with **1 copy offsite or cloud-hosted**.
- Any asset stored on only a single drive must be flagged as `unbacked` in `ledger/assets.yaml` or `ledger/drives.yaml`.

## 2. Destructive Action Firewall
Automated batch deletions or bulk reformatting on `/Volumes/` are strictly prohibited. Any file removal requires explicit, per-action human approval.
